  "error_description": "Opening this RFC to discuss CUDA version support for future PyTorch release 2.9: Migration to CUDA 13.0 is planned for release 2.9. Hence following few options possible: Option 1 - CUDA 12.8 (Stable) , 12.9.1 and 13.0; Option 2 - CUDA 12.8 and 12.9.1 (Stable) and 13.0; Option 3 - 12.9.1 (Stable) and 13.0; Option 4 - 12.8 (Stable) and 13.0; Option 5 - CUDA 12.6 CUDA 12.8 (Stable) and 13.0; Option 6 - CUDA 12.6 CUDA 12.9 (Stable) and 13.0. Update as of Aug 18, 2025: Please see the following dev Discuss post regarding addition of CUDA 13.0 nightly builds and deprecation of CUDA 12.9 builds. Update as of Sept 9, 2025: Will be including CUDA aarch64 builds for CUDA 12.6, 12.8 and 13.0 and publishing these on download.pytorch.org.",
